export anchor ThreadedMinimalStyle:
    number: 345
    screen: TeamChat
    name: Threaded minimal
    idea: A chat set like a well kept letter, where there are no avatars, boxes or bubbles, and names, times, indents and one citron underline do all of the work.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #141311, the only surface, screen and style sheet
        ink: #ece6da, messages, names and the current channel
        muted: #a8a092, times, labels, the thread rule and the composer rule
        faint: #3b3832, section rules and quiet underlines only
        citron: #e3d27a, link underlines, Send, the mention count, the current marker and focus
        focusWash: #25231c, the faint wash behind a focused control
    type:
        A book serif, Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino,
        Charter, Georgia, for messages at 17px with 1.6 leading and the
        channel title at 40px weight 400. A system sans for metadata. Names
        are 13px bold capitals tracked 0.08em, times 13px tabular, labels
        11px capitals tracked 0.14em.
    layout:
        A centred 1120px page with two columns, a 230px index and the log,
        64px apart, and no panels at all. The index starts with Brightwork
        Chat in serif italic over Signed in as Mara Okafor, then Channels
        and Direct messages as plain text lists. The current channel is
        italic with a citron arrow before it. Unread channels are bold with
        4 unread in small sans, the mention channel adds @ 1 mention in
        citron. People carry the marks filled, half and empty circle with
        the words here, away and offline. The log has the channel title,
        a sans line reading Today, five messages, one thread, then a
        hairline. Each message is a two column row, the time right aligned
        in a 56px gutter, the name in capitals and the text below, at a 62
        character measure. The thread under Aiko's message is indented
        behind a 1px muted left rule with 3 replies in thread and Thumbs up
        3, Eyes 1 in words. The image is an italic line, shared an image,
        with the filename as an underlined link. The composer is Priya is
        typing in italic, then a bare field on one rule with Attach, Emoji
        and Send as small tracked capitals words. Below 800px the index
        becomes inline wrapped runs above the log.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px between messages, 64px between index and log, 56px top margin.
    density: Sparse. A 62 character measure and generous leading, like reading prose.
    corners: None anywhere.
    borders: Only rules. A 1px muted left rule for the thread indent and a 1px rule under the composer.
    shadows: None.
    icons: No icons. An arrow marks the current channel, filled, half and empty circles mark presence, always with words.
    focus: A 2px citron underline with the faint warm wash behind the control.
    tone: Quiet and literary, such as shared an image, 3 replies in thread and Priya is typing.
